  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "7:16 P.M. \\ Clear\nLungmen Central Park, Finball Stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "Your finballs."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Female Tourist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "Oooh, such springy mouthfeel. Pretty good."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Female Tourist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "This place definitely earned that recommendation in the Great Foodie Guide!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "Glad you like it."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Male Tourist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Male Tourist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "...That finball guy kinda gives me the creeps."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Female Tourist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "I know what you mean. Like, you're selling finballs, why do you have a big knife on the counter there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Male Tourist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "The Foodie Guide says the owner is an old man called 'The Godly Finball Uncle.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Male Tourist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "He couldn't be some kind of triad or something..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "Hm? Did you want something else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Female Tourist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "Oh, no."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "...customers have been so weird lately."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I'm sure it's got nothing to do with that 'Resting Triad Face' you've got going on."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "And this is what you wear to work? Think about how this makes Uncle Tung look."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "Welcome back. Done with work?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "You could say that. The office said you took some credit. How much?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "32.60, rounded. You want to try one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "Where'd that come from? I don't have any change on me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "Consider it a token of my appreciation for doing so much to look after my business."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "All right. Don't mind if I do."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "Hmm..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "It's tasty and all, but isn't this Uncle Tung's stall? A tribute made with borrowed goods is one without meaning."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "You always have to get your digs in. This one's on me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "Okay then. You've definitely gotten better. I wish the other punks took things as seriously as you do."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Evening. I'll take some finballs."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "Coming right up."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Take your time. I'm just enjoying the view of the river. Usually don't see it from this far away."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Smells nice. The Great Foodie Guide never gets it wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "...order up. Here's your change."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "Please come again."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "Waai Fu? What are you looking at?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "It's just that girl kinda weirded me out... do Sankta grow horns?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "Must be some Sauin makeup or something."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "They looked real. Whatever. Idle gossip is an unbecoming habit."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "What's next on the agenda? Back to the office?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "Studying. I've got a test in two days."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "You're spending Sauin studying?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "Sauin is supposed to be about shepherding spirits into the afterlife. Our society has totally corrupted it with consumerism. Respectfully, I will abstain."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "Not to mention, I don't get paid that much. I need to get my grades up and nab a scholarship."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "Yeah, that sounds about right for you..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "It's their fault for being so out of touch. Don't lump me in with them."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "Hm, I've still got some time. Where should I go next? Let's see, looks like there's some good eats around here..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Curious Lungmenite",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Woah! What's happening up on the overpass? A car crash?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Strolling Lungmenite",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Doesn't seem like a regular crash. Let's go check it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Easygoing Lungmenite",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Another street fight? Count me in!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Friggin psychos, get away from meee!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "Oh... so soon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "Looks like I'm on the clock already."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "Ow... I was thrown clear...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Thank heaven for guard rails. Otherwise we'd be a puddle down there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Hurry up! Pull me out!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "They're trying to get away! Stay on them!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Mmmff! This... airbag... it's smooshing me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Hold still! You're gonna crush my Lil Homie! Yo! Croissant! It's comin' outta your pay!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "It ain't me! I can't move at all with Texas on top of me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Oof."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "Then I guess it's up to me——!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Bison! Wait!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "Everyone's crowding around. If they get away now we'll never catch them!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "Pull me out already! That Forte kid's coming!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "I'm trying!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "Don't move!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "So... heavy..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "Who——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "A sniper?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Yo, Texas."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "On it."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "(They missed. Bad shot?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "(No, they're trying to hit the fuel tank——!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "Huh, what's going on? Who's shooting at the Forte kid?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "Focus! The wolf's on her way too! Pull me out already!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "Wait, what's that smell? It's fuel! Hurry!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "Brother... it's what it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "You son of a——!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "Damn! I can't——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "Ugh. Too late."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
